	(text "3V3: ME6211C33M5 LDO (as on microfrank), CE tied to VIN. 10u in, 10u out.\nLoad ~150-250 mA: (4.6 V - 3.3 V) x 0.2 A = 0.26 W in SOT-23-5, give it a copper pad.\nRP2350 makes its own 1V1 (on-chip buck)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "03743ec5-06ea-420c-9696-d6e728bd28ae")
	)
	(text "5 V in: native USB-C -> VBUS_USB -> Schottky -> VBUS rail (no fuse: 5 V-only USB input).\nVBUS rail feeds the PIO-USB port VBUS (5 V to the USB device) and the 3V3 LDO;\nthe Schottky stops a supply on the PIO-USB port back-feeding the native port.\nThe second Schottky feeds HDMI +5V (M_HV_5V) from VBUS_USB, one diode drop;\na powered sink cannot back-feed the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ec1535a3-e7ba-4300-a727-f25c8a7e6e7e")
	)
